    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #65 Post-Mortem & Parameter Mutation\nForensic analysis of Cycle #65 revealed severe fee attrition (\u20b947.93 fees on \u20b9-59.96 net P&L) and clustered mid-morning stop-outs on 2026-10-22 due to tight stops (`min_sl_pct: 0.45%`) getting clipped by routine NSE 5m mean-reversion noise. Furthermore, gross-positive trades in ICICIBANK and COALINDIA flipped to net losses after brokerage and taxes upon premature breakeven triggers and late-session decay. To correct this, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to `0.60%` to survive intraday liquidity sweeps, elevating `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to `2.40x` to filter out low-conviction mid-day false breakouts, pushing `breakeven_trigger_r` to `1.25R` to give winning trades room to breathe while locking in a buffer above transaction costs, and expanding `min_target_pct` to `1.50%` to restore asymmetric reward-to-risk post-fees."
